                                "sense_id": "f3b5f5bd-4df1-3552-a699-567437ef7278",
                                "text": "The Ukrainians, the Finns and the peoples of the Caucasus strove for their independence. […] After his recovery, Father had been transferred to the city of Liman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a24f6359-fa23-4647-8175-8ab5c627ea6e",
                                "sense_id": "f3b5f5bd-4df1-3552-a699-567437ef7278",
                                "text": "Kharkov Region, Zmewsk District, the Donets River, between trans-Donets settlements and town of Liman; […]"
                            }
                        ]
